    "heldOut": "W25-W50: 26 additional works / 52 pages. The prompt was frozen before examining these outputs and no examples from them were added to the prompt. W28-P2 exposed a hallucination and informed the numeric guard, so guarded is a regression rerun on these pages, not an untouched held-out estimate.",
    "selectionLimitations": "Convenience sample from the user-provided local collection, mostly fantasy/reincarnation with romance, comedy, science-fiction, gaming and idol material. Two sampled pages do not cover every chapter or all genres. Some pages are covers or have no eligible ordinary text. This is not human gold or a population accuracy estimate.",
    "workflow": [
      "createWorkflowSessions",
      "detectWorkflowBlocks",
      "readWorkflowSource",
      "translateWorkflowPage",
      "runWholePagePipeline"
    ],
    "isolation": "Production modules in isolated Electron userData/library/log/settings roots; existing model/native caches reused. Original images copied, Hayai OCR frozen for paired translation runs. No erase, typeset or export stage, no UI interaction, and no user output overwrite.",
    "context": "Japanese-to-Korean, cumulative context disabled and an empty per-work glossary/story memory. Cross-chapter name consistency with nonempty memory was not evaluated.",
